<DocsLayout title="Installation">
  <h1>Installation</h1>
  <p class="muted">
    Writer is currently distributed as macOS-only. The repository includes build scripts for Windows/Linux.
  </p>

  <h2>macOS</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Download the latest macOS build.</li>
    <li>Open Writer and allow permissions if prompted.</li>
    <li>Your default notes vault is created at <code>~/Writer</code>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Build from source</h2>
  <p class="muted">If you prefer building locally (or on other platforms), use the contributor docs:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/docs/developer/run-locally">Run locally</a></li>
    <li><a href="/docs/developer/architecture">Architecture overview</a></li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>

